.DS_Store

# Pod scratch results root. Set PCPG_RESULTS_ROOT=results_pod on a pod so sweeps
# never write into the tracked results/ tree -- that collision is what makes
# `git pull` fail on the pod with "untracked working tree files would be
# overwritten". Transfer results_pod/ to the Mac with runpodctl, then commit from
# there into results/.
results_pod/
